Depends:
 libcurl4-openssl-dev | libcurl-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: header-only C++23 client for the FortiGate REST API
 forti-api is a header-only C++23 SDK for the FortiGate REST API (FortiOS v2),
 built around strongly typed domain models with intrusive nlohmann::json
 serialization: firewall policies, services, schedules and VIPs, DNS filter,
 threat feeds and system interfaces.
 .
 The headers install to /usr/include/forti_api with a vendored nlohmann/json
 under /usr/include/forti_api/third_party (no conflict with nlohmann-json3-dev).
 Build against it with `pkg-config --cflags --libs forti-api`.
